ext":"This river is longer than that one."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"两者用 longer than。","verify":"\"This river is longer than that one.\""},{"id":"cne_j169_q3","topicId":"cne_j169","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"三者以上用哪一种形式？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"最高级"},{"key":"B","text":"只用不加 the 的原级"},{"key":"C","text":"只用比较级加 than"},{"key":"D","text":"动词过去式"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"三者以上用最高级。","verify":"\"最高级\""},{"id":"cne_j169_q4","topicId":"cne_j169","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句是两者比较？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The Pacific Ocean is the largest ocean in the world."},{"key":"B","text":"The Pacific Ocean is larger than the Atlantic Ocean."},{"key":"C","text":"The Pacific Ocean is large."},{"key":"D","text":"Oceans are blue."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"larger than 比较两个大洋。","verify":"\"The Pacific Ocean is larger than the Atlantic Ocean.\""},{"id":"cne_j170_q1","topicId":"cne_j170","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想说这片沙漠很大，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"This desert is very larger."},{"key":"B","text":"This desert is the larger."},{"key":"C","text":"This desert are very large."},{"key":"D","text":"This desert is very large."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"陈述事实、不比较时用原级 large。","verify":"\"This desert is very large.\""},{"id":"cne_j170_q2","topicId":"cne_j170","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问世界上最高的山是哪座，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"What is the highest mountain in the world?"},{"key":"B","text":"What is the higher mountain in the world?"},{"key":"C","text":"What is highest mountain in the world?"},{"key":"D","text":"What is the most high mountain in the world?"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"the highest。","verify":"\"What is the highest mountain in the world?\""},{"id":"cne_j170_q3","topicId":"cne_j170","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"想说我们应该保护海洋，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"We should to protect the ocean."},{"key":"B","text":"We should protect the ocean."},{"key":"C","text":"We should protects the ocean."},{"key":"D","text":"We should protecting the ocean."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"should protect。","verify":"\"We should protect the ocean.\""},{"id":"cne_j170_q4","topicId":"cne_j170","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"It is 8,848.86 meters high. 这句在说什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"它的年龄"},{"key":"B","text":"它的人口"},{"key":"C","text":"它的高度"},{"key":"D","text":"它的票价"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"meters high 表示高度。","verify":"\"它的高度\""},{"id":"cne_j171_q1","topicId":"cne_j171","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Qomolangma is the highest mountain in the world. It is higher than any other mountain. 它是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"世界上最高的山"},{"key":"B","text":"一条河"},{"key":"C","text":"一片沙漠"},{"key":"D","text":"一个海洋"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"the highest mountain。","verify":"\"世界上最高的山\""},{"id":"cne_j171_q2","topicId":"cne_j171","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"The Nile is the longest river in the world. The Amazon is shorter than the Nile. 哪条河更短？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"尼罗河"},{"key":"B","text":"亚马孙河"},{"key":"C","text":"两样长"},{"key":"D","text":"珠穆朗玛峰"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"The Amazon is shorter。","verify":"\"亚马孙河\""},{"id":"cne_j171_q3","topicId":"cne_j171","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"The Sahara is a great desert. We should protect the animals there. 我们应该做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"离开所有沙漠"},{"key":"B","text":"把河移走"},{"key":"C","text":"保护那里的动物"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"protect the animals there。","verify":"\"保护那里的动物\""},{"id":"cne_j171_q4","topicId":"cne_j171","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"The Nile is the longest river in the world. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The Amazon is longer than the Nile."},{"key":"B","text":"Qomolangma is a river."},{"key":"C","text":"The Sahara is an ocean."},{"key":"D","text":"No river in this text is longer than the Nile."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"Nile 是文中最长的河。","verify":"\"No river in this text is longer than the Nile.\""},{"id":"cne_j172_q1","topicId":"cne_j172","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Tom ___ to the library yesterday. He read an old book about the ocean. 横线处选哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"goes"},{"key":"B","text":"went"},{"key":"C","text":"going"},{"key":"D","text":"will go"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"yesterday 要用过去式 went。","verify":"\"went\""},{"id":"cne_j172_q2","topicId":"cne_j172","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"The Sahara is one of ___ deserts in the world. 横线处选哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"bigger"},{"key":"B","text":"big"},{"key":"C","text":"the biggest"},{"key":"D","text":"the bigger"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"one of 后面用 the 加最高级。","verify":"\"the biggest\""},{"id":"cne_j172_q3","topicId":"cne_j172","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Mary was reading ___ the rainstorm came. 横线处选哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"but"},{"key":"B","text":"unless"},{"key":"C","text":"so that"},{"key":"D","text":"when"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"一个短动作到来，用 when。","verify":"\"when\""},{"id":"cne_j172_q4","topicId":"cne_j172","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"We should ___ the animals in the desert. They are in danger. 横线处选哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"protect"},{"key":"B","text":"protected"},{"key":"C","text":"protecting"},{"key":"D","text":"to protect"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"should 后面用动词原形 protect。","verify":"\"protect\""}]
